  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "**7:00 a.m.** So this is it — {senior} high school at last! I'm not {outgoing} so I'm a little {anxious} right now. I want to make a good first {impression}. Will I make any friends? What if no one talks to me?",
      "cn": "**上午 7:00**：终于，就这样开始了——高中生活！我性格不外向，所以现在有点儿焦虑。我想给人留下好的第一印象。我会交到朋友吗？要是没人跟我说话怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "**12:30 p.m.** I just had my first maths class at {senior} high school! The class was difficult, but the teacher was kind and friendly. He even told us a funny story and everyone laughed so much! I found most of my classmates and teachers friendly and helpful.",
      "cn": "**下午 12:30**：我刚刚上了高中的第一节数学课！这堂课很难，但老师很和蔼、友好。他甚至给我们讲了一个有趣的故事，大家都笑得前仰后合！我发现我的大多数同学和老师都很友好、乐于助人。"
    },
    {
      "num": "03",
      "en": "**5:32 p.m.** This afternoon, we had our chemistry class in the science lab. The lab is new and the lesson was great, but the {guy} next to me tried to talk to me the whole time. I couldn't {concentrate} on the {experiment}. I really wanted to tell him to please be quiet and leave me alone!",
      "cn": "**下午 5:32**：今天下午，我们在科学实验室上了化学课。实验室是新的，课也很棒，但坐在我旁边的那个家伙一直试图跟我说话。我无法集中精力做实验。我真想让他安静点，别来打扰我！"
    },
    {
      "num": "04",
      "en": "**10:29 p.m.** What a day! This morning, I was worried that no one would talk to me. But I was wrong. I didn't feel {awkward} or {frightened} at all. I miss my friends from {junior} high school, but I believe I will make new friends here and there's a lot to {explore} at {senior} high. I feel much more {confident} than I felt this morning. I think that tomorrow will be a great day!",
      "cn": "**晚上 10:29**：多好的一天啊！今天早上我还担心没人会跟我说话。但我错了。我一点儿也不觉得尴尬、害怕了。我想念初中的朋友们，但我相信我在这里会交到新朋友，而且高中有很多值得探索的东西。我感觉比今天早上自信多了。我想明天会是美好的一天！"
    }
  ],
